    "删除手机上的主机设置、密码和私钥，主机上的对话保留。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Löscht die Host-Einstellungen, das Passwort und den privaten Schlüssel von diesem iPhone. Unterhaltungen auf dem Host bleiben erhalten."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deletes the host settings, password, and private key from this iPhone. Conversations on the host are kept."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Elimina de este iPhone los ajustes, la contraseña y la clave privada del host. Las conversaciones del host se conservan."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Supprime de cet iPhone les réglages de l’hôte, le mot de passe et la clé privée. Les conversations sur l’hôte sont conservées."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Elimina da questo iPhone le impostazioni dell'host, la password e la chiave privata. Le conversazioni sull'host vengono conservate."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "この iPhone からホスト設定、パスワード、秘密鍵を削除します。ホスト上の会話は残ります。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "휴대폰에 저장된 호스트 설정, 암호, 개인 키를 삭제해요. 호스트의 대화는 그대로 남아요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Exclui os ajustes do host, a senha e a chave privada deste iPhone. As conversas no host são mantidas."
