    "请在 Xcode → Settings → Apple Accounts 登录自己的 Apple 账号并查看团队。若已登录仍未识别，在 Manage Certificates 中创建 Apple Development 证书。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Melde dich in Xcode unter Settings → Apple Accounts mit deinem Apple-Account an und prüfe dein Team. Wird es weiterhin nicht erkannt, erstelle unter Manage Certificates ein Apple-Development-Zertifikat."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sign in to your Apple Account in Xcode → Settings → Apple Accounts and check your team. If it is still not detected, create an Apple Development certificate in Manage Certificates."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Inicia sesión con tu cuenta de Apple en Xcode → Settings → Apple Accounts y revisa tu equipo. Si sigue sin detectarse, crea un certificado Apple Development en Manage Certificates."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connectez-vous à votre compte Apple dans Xcode → Settings → Apple Accounts et vérifiez votre équipe. Si elle n’est toujours pas détectée, créez un certificat Apple Development dans Manage Certificates."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Accedi con il tuo account Apple in Xcode → Settings → Apple Accounts e controlla il team. Se non viene ancora rilevato, crea un certificato Apple Development in Manage Certificates."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「Xcode → Settings → Apple Accounts」でご自身のAppleアカウントにサインインして、チームを確認してください。サインインしても認識されない場合は、Manage CertificatesでApple Development証明書を作成してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"Xcode → Settings → Apple Accounts\"에서 본인의 Apple 계정으로 로그인하고 팀을 확인하세요. 로그인했는데도 인식되지 않으면 Manage Certificates에서 Apple Development 인증서를 만드세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Entre com seu ID Apple em Xcode → Settings → Apple Accounts e confira sua equipe. Se ainda não for detectada, crie um certificado Apple Development em Manage Certificates."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Войдите в свою учётную запись Apple в Xcode → Settings → Apple Accounts и проверьте команду. Если она всё равно не определяется, создайте сертификат Apple Development в Manage Certificates."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "請在「Xcode → Settings → Apple Accounts」登入你自己的 Apple 帳號並查看團隊。若已登入仍未辨識，請在 Manage Certificates 中建立 Apple Development 憑證。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请在打开的页面里登录，完成后会回到这里。" : {
